\label{Lp_bound}
    The spaces $B_{p,q}^{\phi}(\mathbb{R}^d,w\,\mathrm{d}x)$ and $F_{p,q}^{\phi}(\mathbb{R}^d,w\,\mathrm{d}x)$ are continuously embedded into $L_p(\mathbb{R}^d,w\,\mathrm{d}x)$;
    $$
    	\|f\|_{L_p(\mathbb{R}^d,w\,\mathrm{d}x)}\leq N\min(\|f\|_{B_{p,q}^{\phi}(\mathbb{R}^d,w\,\mathrm{d}x)},\|f\|_{F_{p,q}^{\phi}(\mathbb{R}^d,w\,\mathrm{d}x)}).
